The shim product derives glyph outlines from this font into printed geometry; it
does not ship the font as a standalone typeface. The file is vendored verbatim
from three.js (examples/fonts/droid/droid_sans_bold.typeface.json), which
redistributes the Droid family under the Apache 2.0 license above. (The font's
embedded nameID-13 string is the original Ascender foundry boilerplate; the
operative license for the Android Open Source Project release is Apache 2.0.)
